		<description><![CDATA[Tender gentle Dancer
Sister of Life and Dance
Suddenly called away
To dance another Dance

The Dancing of Karima
Brought light and grace to all
To see her radiant smile
Her devoted quiet call

Karima the traveller
Journeyed to Iran
Sharing precious blessing
Doing all she can

Karima the steadfast
The Dancing gentle light
Karima we miss you
And know you are in the Light]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Tender gentle Dancer<br />
Sister of Life and Dance<br />
Suddenly called away<br />
To dance another Dance</p>
<p>The Dancing of Karima<br />
Brought light and grace to all<br />
To see her radiant smile<br />
Her devoted quiet call</p>
<p>Karima the traveller<br />
Journeyed to Iran<br />
Sharing precious blessing<br />
Doing all she can</p>
<p>Karima the steadfast<br />
The Dancing gentle light<br />
Karima we miss you<br />
And know you are in the Light</p>
]]></content:encoded>
